# Account 1: 2 orders per second, burst 2. T lines set the simulated time (ns).
A 1 1 - - - - 2 2
T 0
N 2 1 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 1
N 3 2 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 1
N 4 3 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 1
# Cancels are never throttled; account 2 has no rate limit.
C 5 1
N 6 4 2 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 1
# Just under half a second refills 0.999999998 tokens; exactly half a second, one.
T 499999999
N 7 5 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 1
T 500000000
N 8 6 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 1
# A replace costs a token too.
R 9 2 100 2
